<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Telemetry and reading labels (batch B3): the names of the scooter's readings, their groups, the words
  Live Stats shows for some stored values, the ride and charge chart legends, and the telemetry history
  status. The English must stay exactly what the source said before the batch (G1, G2).

  Every reading has a narrow-label ladder: readings_<key> is the full name (the reading's name in
  Telemetry, which reports and diagnostics keep in English), readings_<key>_short the name on Home cards
  and Live Stats rows, and readings_<key>_compact, where there is one, the name on physically narrow
  cards. Translate every rung of a ladder. "(raw)" marks a value the scooter reports undecoded.
  Unit symbols (V, A, W, km/h) stay as they are; words are translated.
-->
